# F6: exactness of the fused commit on real text: the gate's matrix plan on c2-packed-tp4-gate-fcommit-quad (fused commit in place, live banks, quad,
# every audit on, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_SINGLES_AUDIT=all): four real-text users at 2,560 / 3,072 / 4,096 / 16,384 tokens (all past the 2,048-row window, so the
# concurrent arm's packed-4 rounds are quad rounds and every commit is fused), 256 tokens out, a concurrent arm and a solo arm, strict policy.
# C2_GATE_JIT=record: the kernel-cache growth is recorded, not judged (no four-card warm plan exists).
# Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min; per arm an engine build 5-15 min plus 4-10 min of streams: 25 / 45 / 120 min.
# Read: the gate verdict per arm; per user IDENTICAL concurrent against solo; the audits clean (extent, T1, T2 and every fused-commit audit line
# checked=80 mismatches=0); zero unexpected refusals; the [ACCEPT] line; at least 20 audited rounds. A draft defect is an audit mismatch, an unequal
# [DRAFT-SINGLES-AUDIT] line, or a differing concurrent prefix sequence against the eager arm in speed_window_compare (--position-keyed
# --strict-concurrent-prefixes). A text difference alone is a verify-side finding (the ring-order fix lives on tp4/exact), not a fused-commit one.
# SOFT job, last.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card fused-commit window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/fcommit and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN (the tag numbers are
# the driver's, on the allowlist). Nothing here names a rig, a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image F0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fcommit-1 is a PLACEHOLDER: set it (in every template of the window) to the tag the driver picks.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fcommit-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-gate-fcommit-quad
C2_GATE_PLAN=matrix
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=2560,3072,4096,16384
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=256
C2_GATE_JIT=record
